    {
      "text": "肯定蔣萬安市長採納闕枚莎建議續辦「班班喝鮮乳」呼籲數位鮮乳兌...",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=BEDFC53B968EAFB7"
    },
    {
      "text": "...詳全文",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=BEDFC53B968EAFB7"
    },
    {
      "text": "班班恐喝不到「鮮乳」?闕枚莎力推牛奶兌換券結合超商配送政策",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=8EBDD3ACE4FD53DE"
    },
    {
      "text": "...詳全文",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=8EBDD3ACE4FD53DE"
    },
    {
      "text": "闕枚莎提出行銷臺北低頭可見城市美學",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=EA614BF43667CB03"
    },
    {
      "text": "...詳全文",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=EA614BF43667CB03"
    },
    {
      "text": "關心市民健康，闕枚莎請衛生局擬擴大補助肺癌篩檢對象",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=E157230455684C07"
    },
    {
      "text": "...詳全文",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=E157230455684C07"
    },
    {
      "text": "爭取婦女權益，闕枚莎請衛生局研議凍卵補助政策",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=A426EC8CC9347A62"
    },
    {
      "text": "...詳全文",
      "url": "https://tcc9515.tcc.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?n=0E0C201F79A61D64&sms=30CBF6CB19368AAA&s=A426EC8CC9347A62"
